WEBVTT

00:35.027 --> 00:36.627
In the World Beyond,

00:37.027 --> 00:39.067
humans take Potions

00:39.787 --> 00:42.187
to gain various Beyonder powers

00:42.467 --> 00:45.227
and advance to higher Sequences
in a Pathway.

00:46.747 --> 00:49.027
All 22 Pathways

00:49.427 --> 00:51.347
begin from Sequence 9,

00:52.147 --> 00:53.987
and the lower the Sequence number is,

00:54.507 --> 00:56.787
the stronger the Beyonder powers.

00:58.027 --> 00:59.667
A High-Sequence Beyonder

01:00.227 --> 01:03.387
can possess powers
comparable to a deity.

01:04.427 --> 01:07.027
And such Pathways

01:08.027 --> 01:10.267
are Pathways to Divinity.

01:24.275 --> 01:25.739
(Be what the potion name refers to)

01:25.739 --> 01:27.199
(and strictly adhere to its rules.)

01:29.267 --> 01:30.817
(The phrasing should be clear enough.)

01:32.217 --> 01:33.545
(I must tell Captain tomorrow.)

01:34.137 --> 01:36.057
(I hope incidents
like Mr. Folan's derailment)

01:36.417 --> 01:37.897
(never occur among our ranks.)

02:12.851 --> 02:13.691
Klein.

02:15.571 --> 02:16.411
Don't shoot.

02:22.651 --> 02:23.491
It's me.

02:25.331 --> 02:26.211
Ms. Daly?

02:26.891 --> 02:28.971
I know this visit is abrupt,

02:29.611 --> 02:31.331
but I just received Dunn's letter.

02:31.731 --> 02:32.811
This matter is urgent.

02:33.291 --> 02:35.131
So I had to use this little guy

02:35.251 --> 02:36.811
to expedite my return to Tingen

02:37.331 --> 02:38.531
and secretly talk with you.

02:39.691 --> 02:41.571
Won't you seal the room
with Spirituality?

02:42.331 --> 02:44.651
If a female voice
emerges from your bedroom...

02:46.411 --> 02:47.251
Of course,

02:47.691 --> 02:49.091
personally I don't mind

02:49.371 --> 02:51.211
being misunderstood by your siblings.

02:55.411 --> 02:56.811
It's indeed Ms. Daly.

03:03.571 --> 03:04.771
Dunn's letter mentioned

03:04.891 --> 03:06.651
you submitted
an advancement application.

03:07.691 --> 03:09.691
He expressed concerns in his letter,

03:10.291 --> 03:11.251
but mostly

03:11.611 --> 03:12.931
it was his worry for you.

03:14.131 --> 03:14.971
However,

03:15.251 --> 03:16.091
I know

03:17.051 --> 03:17.891
you've

03:18.211 --> 03:20.371
discovered the acting method.

03:22.651 --> 03:23.491
The acting method?

03:23.891 --> 03:24.731
What's that?

03:25.051 --> 03:25.891
Enough.

03:26.331 --> 03:27.611
No need for pretense with me.

03:28.771 --> 03:31.451
Full digestion of a potion
in such a short time.

03:31.651 --> 03:33.091
If it was not acting method,

03:33.931 --> 03:34.771
then

03:35.331 --> 03:36.971
you'd be a vile heretic.

03:37.611 --> 03:38.571
And you will face

03:38.971 --> 03:40.851
Arbitration Tribunal's judgment.

03:43.131 --> 03:43.971
My discovery came

03:44.491 --> 03:45.651
through the goddess's grace.

03:46.651 --> 03:49.451
Glad we're swiftly candid about this.

03:50.931 --> 03:52.451
It took me nearly two years.

03:53.131 --> 03:53.971
While you

03:54.051 --> 03:55.811
spent merely two months
to become a Beyonder.

03:57.611 --> 03:59.371
How unpleasant.

04:01.371 --> 04:02.211
Ma'am,

04:02.571 --> 04:03.411
the headquarters

04:03.411 --> 04:04.667
know the acting method, right?

04:09.211 --> 04:10.731
In The Revelations of Evernight,

04:11.211 --> 04:12.475
the Evernight organization

04:12.475 --> 04:13.811
traced back to the Third Epoch.

04:14.811 --> 04:15.851
Over millennia,

04:16.451 --> 04:18.411
no low-ranked Nighthawks
knew this secret.

04:19.251 --> 04:20.491
Such deliberate concealment

04:21.171 --> 04:22.731
has a convincing reason, I suppose?

04:23.411 --> 04:24.851
The reason eludes me too.

04:25.451 --> 04:26.651
I only dare mention the phrase

04:26.771 --> 04:28.411
to fellow discoverers who have also

04:28.691 --> 04:30.011
mastered it like you.

04:31.611 --> 04:33.651
Headquarters compel
the acting method's discoverers

04:33.891 --> 04:35.811
to vow secrecy immediately.

04:36.331 --> 04:37.723
That's how I missed

04:37.723 --> 04:38.891
informing Dunn before.

04:39.851 --> 04:40.691
Thus,

04:41.011 --> 04:41.851
Klein,

04:42.211 --> 04:43.611
I need you to explain this method

04:43.771 --> 04:44.811
clearly to Dunn

04:45.251 --> 04:46.891
before Holy Cathedral's arrival.

04:47.331 --> 04:48.171
The Holy Cathedral?

04:49.291 --> 04:50.939
Given you are a weirdo

04:50.939 --> 04:52.507
who discovered it within two months...

04:52.651 --> 04:53.491
Sorry,

04:53.491 --> 04:54.331
a genius.

04:55.011 --> 04:56.091
(Holy Cathedral)

04:56.171 --> 04:57.531
(will prioritize you highly.)

04:58.051 --> 04:58.891
(Undoubtedly,)

04:59.411 --> 05:02.411
(their people are rushing
to Tingen now.)

05:03.531 --> 05:04.371
Klein,

05:05.051 --> 05:06.691
we're running out of time.

05:08.451 --> 05:09.291
Rest assured,

05:09.291 --> 05:10.131
Ms. Daly.

05:10.691 --> 05:11.971
I'll inform Captain

05:12.571 --> 05:13.411
and others now.

05:14.159 --> 05:16.987
=Episode 9=
(Gathering: We Are Pathetic)

05:27.331 --> 05:28.171
What?

05:28.171 --> 05:29.171
You've already dige...

05:30.557 --> 05:31.707
You've mastered your Potion?

05:32.011 --> 05:34.291
(Meant 'digested', didn't you?)

05:34.571 --> 05:35.611
(You know a lot.)

05:37.451 --> 05:38.291
Mr. Neil.

05:40.211 --> 05:41.051
What's wrong?

05:41.611 --> 05:42.571
What happened?

05:43.051 --> 05:43.891
Mr. Neil,

05:43.891 --> 05:44.771
this is unbelievable.

05:45.051 --> 05:46.611
Klein is advancing to Sequence 8.

05:47.171 --> 05:48.011
Sequence...

05:48.691 --> 05:49.611
How's that possible?

05:49.851 --> 05:52.011
I-It's only been two months.

05:52.011 --> 05:52.851
Mr. Neil,

05:53.371 --> 05:54.211
for advancement,

05:54.731 --> 05:55.651
the name of a Potion

05:55.971 --> 05:56.811
is crucial.

05:59.331 --> 06:00.291
(Like Ms. Daly,)

06:00.411 --> 06:01.651
(who is a true Spirit Medium,)

06:02.611 --> 06:04.811
(I've been striving
to be a genuine Seer,)

06:05.491 --> 06:06.571
(and I've formulated a set)

06:06.731 --> 06:07.571
(of Seer's rules.)

06:11.971 --> 06:12.811
(Similar to)

06:12.955 --> 06:13.975
(Mystery Pryer's motto.)

06:14.971 --> 06:16.451
Do as you wish,

06:17.251 --> 06:18.411
but do not harm.

06:18.931 --> 06:19.771
That's right.

06:19.771 --> 06:20.611
It's the core.

06:21.451 --> 06:22.291
The Potion's name

06:22.371 --> 06:24.011
represents who we truly should become

06:24.651 --> 06:26.211
and defines the rules we must follow.

06:27.171 --> 06:31.131
So you drew inspiration
from the Mystery Pryer's motto?

06:32.651 --> 06:33.651
If only

06:34.171 --> 06:36.331
I had met you

06:36.891 --> 06:37.771
20 years earlier...

06:40.691 --> 06:41.531
Mr. Neil.

06:41.611 --> 06:42.451
Captain!

06:44.211 --> 06:45.051
Captain!

07:27.331 --> 07:28.211
Goddess's Sword?

07:28.771 --> 07:30.331
Mr. Crestet Cesimar?

07:30.331 --> 07:31.451
(Crestet Cesimar, Goddess's Sword)

07:31.451 --> 07:32.291
(A senior deacon of Nighthawks)
Yes.

07:32.691 --> 07:34.091
(Sequence 5: Spirit Warlock, Sleepless Pathway)
A senior deacon of Nighthawks

07:34.771 --> 07:36.891
and one of the three powerhouses
of the Red Gloves.

07:37.411 --> 07:38.251
The Red Gloves?

07:38.531 --> 07:39.811
The legendary elite team?

07:41.051 --> 07:42.299
Mr. Cesimar has recognition

07:42.299 --> 07:44.051
from the holy artifact Goddess's Sword.

07:44.611 --> 07:46.251
He's as powerful
as a Sequence 4, Demigod.

07:47.091 --> 07:48.011
I've never heard of him

07:48.731 --> 07:51.171
personally overseeing
a Sequence 8 advancement assessment.

07:51.531 --> 07:52.691
(If it's just an assessment,)

07:52.971 --> 07:54.451
(what's with the interrogation room?)

07:54.976 --> 07:57.235
Nightmare.

07:58.891 --> 08:01.371
Have you gained inspiration
from the Mystery Pryer's motto

08:01.371 --> 08:02.411
and Daly's example?

08:02.731 --> 08:03.571
Yes.

08:05.651 --> 08:08.051
Why did you share it
with your teammates?

08:08.411 --> 08:09.251
We...

08:09.851 --> 08:11.931
We are partners facing dangers together.

08:12.771 --> 08:14.291
I see no reason to keep it a secret.

08:15.891 --> 08:18.291
Have you heard any whispers
from evil deities?

08:19.091 --> 08:19.931
No.

08:20.011 --> 08:22.091
Have you been tempted by demons?

08:22.971 --> 08:25.891
Are you hiding any unspeakable secrets?

08:40.651 --> 08:41.491
Klein?

08:42.371 --> 08:43.867
Are you alright, Klein?

08:43.867 --> 08:45.083
No need to worry.

08:45.891 --> 08:48.411
Your teammate
has exceptional mastery over the Potion.

08:48.691 --> 08:50.491
No physical, mental,
or spiritual risks found.

08:50.691 --> 08:52.091
He's passed the assessment.

08:52.731 --> 08:54.371
He may now advance

08:54.731 --> 08:56.571
to a Sequence 8 Beyonder.

08:56.811 --> 08:57.651
So

08:57.731 --> 08:58.683
Klein wasn't punished

08:58.683 --> 09:00.251
for sharing the method

09:00.451 --> 09:01.371
to master Potions?

09:02.331 --> 09:03.411
It only proves that despite

09:03.571 --> 09:05.531
joining the Nighthawks
just two months ago,

09:05.851 --> 09:07.211
your camaraderie

09:07.411 --> 09:08.531
surpasses many others.

09:09.211 --> 09:10.051
Then why...

09:12.611 --> 09:14.091
To prevent suicide.

09:15.251 --> 09:16.931
Seeking advancement in two months?

09:17.131 --> 09:18.211
First case I've seen.

09:18.611 --> 09:19.451
I just

09:19.771 --> 09:21.131
intensified it slightly.

09:23.291 --> 09:25.851
Your 'hospitality'
is much appreciated, sir.

09:31.371 --> 09:32.211
Alright.

09:32.291 --> 09:33.451
Back to business.

09:44.491 --> 09:45.331
Everyone,

09:45.931 --> 09:47.931
place your hands on the holy artifact

09:48.171 --> 09:49.251
and repeat after me

09:49.611 --> 09:51.131
to make your vows.

09:57.091 --> 09:59.891
The Evernight Goddess,
who stands higher than the cosmos

09:59.891 --> 10:03.811
and more eternal than eternity.

10:03.971 --> 10:09.051
- I swear by my true name and spirituality.
- I swear by my true name and spirituality.

10:09.131 --> 10:11.099
I, Klein/Dunn/Neil/Leonard/
Frye/Royale/Seeka/Kenley,

10:11.411 --> 10:12.691
- shall never disclose
- shall never disclose

10:12.971 --> 10:14.371
- the acting method
- the acting method

10:14.651 --> 10:15.651
- from now on.
- from now on.

10:16.211 --> 10:17.451
- I accept any punishment
- I accept any punishment

10:17.571 --> 10:18.931
- if I break this oath.
- if I break this oath.

10:19.211 --> 10:21.051
- Witness my vow.
- Witness my vow.

10:21.571 --> 10:22.811
- Praise the goddess.
- Praise the goddess.

10:29.491 --> 10:30.331
Alright.

10:31.091 --> 10:31.931
Now is the time

10:32.131 --> 10:33.931
to prepare your Clown Potion.

10:37.411 --> 10:38.571
80 ml of Purified Water.

10:39.099 --> 10:40.409
Five drops of Jimsonweed Juice.

10:40.931 --> 10:42.691
Seven grams
of Black-Rimmed Sunflower Powder.

10:43.227 --> 10:44.827
Ten grams of Golden Cloak Grass Powder.

10:45.531 --> 10:46.971
Three drops of Poison Hemlock Juice.

10:48.491 --> 10:49.971
A Human-Faced Rose Complete Stalk.

10:51.291 --> 10:53.851
And a Hornacis Gray Mountain Goat Horn.

11:11.828 --> 11:12.531
Safe.

11:12.531 --> 11:13.491
You're truly...

11:15.811 --> 11:17.131
a professional Seer.

11:23.851 --> 11:26.051
(Hornacis.)

11:26.051 --> 11:27.971
(Flegrea.)

11:27.971 --> 11:30.171
(Hornacis.)

11:30.171 --> 11:31.971
(Flegrea.)

11:53.811 --> 11:54.971
Congratulations,

11:55.211 --> 11:56.411
Klein Moretti,

11:57.011 --> 11:58.691
on successfully advancing to Sequence 8:

11:59.411 --> 12:00.251
Clown.

12:00.251 --> 12:01.565
(Klein Moretti,
Nighthawks, Evernight Goddess)

12:01.565 --> 12:02.875
(Sequence 8: Clown, Seer Pathway)

12:03.451 --> 12:04.571
You must remember

12:04.691 --> 12:05.811
what I'm about to say.

12:06.371 --> 12:07.611
Delirious whispers or screams

12:07.931 --> 12:10.075
might be malicious utterances
deliberately conveyed by

12:10.075 --> 12:11.091
a High-Sequence Beyonder

12:11.331 --> 12:12.691
of the same Pathway.

12:13.451 --> 12:16.411
If this Pathway belongs
to some evil entity,

12:16.651 --> 12:18.131
you must be even more vigilant.

12:18.531 --> 12:19.611
Once contaminated,

12:20.051 --> 12:21.091
derailment is very likely.

12:21.691 --> 12:23.971
(A High-Sequence Beyonder
of Seer Pathway?)

12:32.091 --> 12:33.731
(The difference is indeed noticeable.)

12:34.251 --> 12:35.251
(My body feels lighter.)

12:35.931 --> 12:37.411
(And I'm more agile and stronger.)

13:00.291 --> 13:01.131
Klein,

13:01.531 --> 13:02.571
you've advanced!

13:02.931 --> 13:03.771
How does it feel?

13:05.491 --> 13:06.331
Still adjusting.

13:10.691 --> 13:11.931
(The hand tying the tie)

13:12.891 --> 13:13.731
(is the left one.)

13:17.571 --> 13:19.936
(Sequence 8 grants me precognition?)

13:20.211 --> 13:21.723
(The Clown Potion's Beyonder powers)

13:21.723 --> 13:22.771
(exceed expectations.)

13:23.971 --> 13:24.859
(Anything more?)

13:43.411 --> 13:44.851
Are there any changes?

13:46.371 --> 13:48.011
(Abilities such as air bullets)

13:48.211 --> 13:49.811
(probably require Sequence 7 or higher.)

13:56.531 --> 13:59.411
Is this another new invisible skill?

14:05.131 --> 14:06.891
Even paper can demonstrate such power!

14:07.291 --> 14:08.131
Impressive!

14:11.411 --> 14:13.171
(I should carry a tarot deck now.)

14:13.171 --> 14:14.011
(With more practice,)

14:14.171 --> 14:15.451
(I'd be Klein the Dart-Thrower,)

14:15.811 --> 14:16.651
(who never misses.)

14:18.051 --> 14:19.651
Klein got to Sequence 8 in two months.

14:20.131 --> 14:21.571
If I work hard for a year or so,

14:21.971 --> 14:22.811
I could do it too.

14:23.491 --> 14:24.931
Advancement...

14:25.611 --> 14:27.011
Youth is so good.

14:30.891 --> 14:31.731
Mr. Neil,

14:31.851 --> 14:32.691
are you alright?

14:34.931 --> 14:36.211
(He seems unwell)

14:37.051 --> 14:37.891
(but still normal.)

14:44.411 --> 14:45.251
(What was that?)

14:48.051 --> 14:49.051
At first,

14:49.411 --> 14:52.451
I tried finding inspiration
in Mystery Pryer's motto

14:52.771 --> 14:54.571
but never managed to find

14:54.771 --> 14:56.131
the correct path.

14:56.411 --> 14:57.251
Mr. Neil...

14:57.531 --> 14:59.011
But life

14:59.251 --> 15:01.091
always has regrets.

15:02.720 --> 15:05.291
Young Klein brought us good fortune.

15:05.731 --> 15:07.923
We should properly
celebrate his advancement!

15:09.731 --> 15:10.851
We should share a drink.

15:11.331 --> 15:12.291
How about Friday?

15:12.531 --> 15:14.051
A restaurant near my place.

15:14.331 --> 15:15.371
And it's my treat.

15:18.571 --> 15:20.811
Let me recall
what you people like to eat.

15:21.451 --> 15:22.411
Honey Roasted Meat,

15:22.571 --> 15:24.571
Fermo Coffee from Paz Valley,

15:25.091 --> 15:26.651
Fried Tussock Fish,

15:26.931 --> 15:27.931
Oyster Soup,

15:28.171 --> 15:29.571
and Pan-Seared Foie Gras.

15:31.531 --> 15:32.531
And the drinks?

15:34.131 --> 15:34.971
Sweet Iced Tea.

15:36.051 --> 15:36.891
What's that?

15:37.771 --> 15:39.331
Smyrin Bakery's new beverage.

15:42.451 --> 15:44.291
Still enjoying sweets at your age?

15:44.771 --> 15:45.971
So childlike.

15:46.451 --> 15:47.411
At times like this,

15:47.531 --> 15:48.371
we should

15:48.371 --> 15:49.531
drink alcohol.

15:50.211 --> 15:51.731
Alright, settled then.

15:51.731 --> 15:55.019
I'll go prepare thoroughly.
See you Friday.

15:58.051 --> 16:01.011
Is he still the same stingy Old Neil?

16:03.904 --> 16:07.955
Let's dine together this Friday.

16:08.275 --> 16:09.115
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

16:10.707 --> 16:11.547
Wait.

16:11.907 --> 16:14.107
Friday's Chanis Gate keeper
seems to be...

16:14.547 --> 16:15.387
Seeka.

16:16.507 --> 16:18.467
Seeka's missing out on this feast.

16:22.935 --> 16:25.886
(Lord of Mysteries)

16:27.165 --> 16:28.035
(Moses Ascetic Order)

16:28.035 --> 16:29.251
(The earliest known
secret organization.)

16:29.251 --> 16:30.179
(Founded in the Fourth Epoch.)

16:30.179 --> 16:31.008
(It controls the Mystery Pryer Pathway.)

16:31.008 --> 16:32.339
(The motto is
'Do as you wish, but do not harm.')

16:33.248 --> 16:34.720
(Friday)

16:34.720 --> 16:38.208
(Old Neil was absent for two days
to prepare for the gathering.)

16:38.208 --> 16:40.147
(It's alright. We'll go get him.)

16:48.387 --> 16:49.827
After knowing Old Neil for so long,

16:50.067 --> 16:51.947
I never knew
he played the piano so well.

16:53.307 --> 16:54.587
The music sounds

16:55.427 --> 16:56.267
rather lonely.

16:57.027 --> 16:57.867
Captain,

16:58.107 --> 16:58.947
I think we should

16:58.947 --> 16:59.947
gather more later.

17:01.547 --> 17:02.587
And keep him company.

17:20.587 --> 17:21.427
The door's open?

17:25.707 --> 17:26.547
Mr. Neil,

17:26.547 --> 17:28.147
it's me, Klein.

17:44.987 --> 17:45.827
Klein?

17:46.547 --> 17:47.587
What brings you here?

17:51.360 --> 17:55.379
Mr. Neil, two days no see. Captain
sent us to take you to the restaurant.

18:03.387 --> 18:04.227
Well...

18:04.627 --> 18:05.467
I...

18:07.067 --> 18:08.507
I'm not ready yet.

18:09.707 --> 18:10.707
No formal attire,

18:10.787 --> 18:11.627
Mr. Neil.

18:11.707 --> 18:12.547
Just come out.

18:12.907 --> 18:13.747
No!

18:14.107 --> 18:14.987
Not today!

18:19.187 --> 18:20.107
Sorry.

18:21.907 --> 18:22.947
Mr. Neil?

18:31.747 --> 18:32.587
Go.

18:32.587 --> 18:33.467
Be quick.

18:36.587 --> 18:38.427
W-What's wrong?

18:46.147 --> 18:46.987
Old Neil,

18:47.307 --> 18:48.147
what's it?

18:48.587 --> 18:49.747
Trying to surprise us?

18:50.747 --> 18:51.587
No.

18:51.747 --> 18:53.147
No surprises.

18:55.627 --> 18:56.507
Actually, I...

18:57.347 --> 18:58.507
I'm feeling unwell.

18:59.307 --> 19:00.147
Let's do dinner

19:00.547 --> 19:01.387
tomorrow instead.

19:02.507 --> 19:03.347
Tomorrow.

19:05.107 --> 19:05.947
Unwell?

19:06.467 --> 19:07.307
Are you sick?

19:08.227 --> 19:09.067
We can

19:09.467 --> 19:10.307
check on you.

19:10.787 --> 19:11.627
If you're fine,

19:11.627 --> 19:12.507
we'll leave.

19:32.427 --> 19:33.307
Liar.

19:34.027 --> 19:34.987
You're lying!

19:44.187 --> 19:45.027
Old Neil,

19:45.667 --> 19:46.507
don't you trust

19:47.147 --> 19:47.987
my word?

19:49.427 --> 19:50.267
Just let us see you.

20:08.827 --> 20:10.147
(I hope we're not too late.)

20:10.747 --> 20:11.587
(Old Neil...)

20:34.427 --> 20:35.267
Alright.

20:35.267 --> 20:36.547
As you can see,

20:37.027 --> 20:37.867
I...

20:38.147 --> 20:39.627
I messed things up a bit.

20:40.387 --> 20:41.227
By tomorrow,

20:41.227 --> 20:42.147
it'll be normal again.

20:43.427 --> 20:44.427
You should go.

20:47.587 --> 20:48.427
Old Neil,

20:48.627 --> 20:49.467
come out first.

20:50.187 --> 20:51.027
Let us see you.

20:51.587 --> 20:52.827
Maybe we can help you.

20:54.387 --> 20:55.227
Dunn,

20:55.747 --> 20:56.707
you promised

20:57.267 --> 20:58.747
you'd leave after you saw me.

20:59.027 --> 20:59.867
Right.

21:00.067 --> 21:01.059
Let us see you.

21:01.059 --> 21:01.947
If there's nothing...

21:01.947 --> 21:02.787
Dunn!

21:03.507 --> 21:04.827
Do as you wish,

21:04.907 --> 21:06.107
but do not harm.

21:06.747 --> 21:08.947
I've always upheld that principle.

21:09.987 --> 21:11.147
I'd rather endure

21:11.707 --> 21:14.027
than harm anyone.

21:14.387 --> 21:17.387
All I ask is this small mercy.

21:17.787 --> 21:18.667
Tomorrow!

21:19.267 --> 21:20.347
Wait until tomorrow!

21:45.307 --> 21:46.267
I know

21:46.707 --> 21:48.267
you call me stingy,

21:48.907 --> 21:52.507
but I've never harmed anyone.

21:53.027 --> 21:53.867
At worst,

21:54.227 --> 21:57.867
I claimed
some questionable reimbursements.

21:58.467 --> 21:59.587
I swear!

22:00.867 --> 22:03.227
I swear by the goddess!

22:06.627 --> 22:07.467
Dunn

22:07.787 --> 22:08.627
and Klein,

22:08.827 --> 22:10.307
please go back.

22:10.947 --> 22:11.787
Tomorrow,

22:12.067 --> 22:14.307
everything will return to normal.

22:15.947 --> 22:16.787
Old Neil,

22:18.747 --> 22:19.587
you misunderstand.

22:23.467 --> 22:24.987
We've known each other 15 years.

22:27.107 --> 22:28.627
I know there's nothing wrong with you.

22:29.147 --> 22:30.187
You're just unwell.

22:32.147 --> 22:33.187
I'm worried about you.

22:34.987 --> 22:36.507
I need to see you

22:37.267 --> 22:38.107
for my peace of mind.

22:40.387 --> 22:42.507
You really aren't here to arrest me?

22:44.147 --> 22:44.987
No.

22:45.827 --> 22:47.107
I swear by the goddess.

22:48.947 --> 22:49.827
Then...

22:50.907 --> 22:51.987
Fine.

22:59.947 --> 23:01.027
Look.

23:01.467 --> 23:03.307
I'm truly fine.

23:04.147 --> 23:04.987
Right?

23:07.987 --> 23:08.907
Old Neil,

23:09.947 --> 23:10.787
what have you

23:11.747 --> 23:12.907
been experimenting with?

23:14.707 --> 23:16.107
You found out.

23:18.387 --> 23:20.187
No harm in telling you.

23:21.027 --> 23:22.747
I'm resurrecting

23:23.387 --> 23:25.187
Celeste.

23:27.907 --> 23:29.787
I've discovered the method.

23:30.347 --> 23:32.147
I'm on the right path.

23:32.667 --> 23:34.987
Twenty years ago, I failed to save her.

23:35.467 --> 23:36.307
But now

23:36.787 --> 23:38.907
(I possess sufficient knowledge
and experience)

23:39.307 --> 23:40.667
(to accomplish this.)

23:43.947 --> 23:45.627
(What a pity)

23:46.707 --> 23:49.427
(that I didn't get inspired
by the Mystery Pryer's motto)

23:49.707 --> 23:52.387
(or Daly's precedent.)

23:56.067 --> 23:59.267
I missed the perfect opportunity.

24:00.067 --> 24:00.907
No!

24:00.907 --> 24:02.307
I can't give up again!

24:03.267 --> 24:04.107
Dunn,

24:04.107 --> 24:05.547
all of you should leave.

24:09.067 --> 24:10.907
How are you planning
to resurrect Celeste?

24:13.427 --> 24:15.547
Resurrect?

24:19.987 --> 24:22.867
Alchemical Life.

24:23.227 --> 24:26.307
I'll craft an ageless body for her.

24:26.707 --> 24:29.387
And then summon her soul
from the Spirit World

24:29.787 --> 24:32.227
to reunite her spirit and flesh.

24:32.507 --> 24:34.667
Isn't that brilliant?

24:34.907 --> 24:35.747
Yes,

24:35.987 --> 24:36.827
very brilliant.

24:37.107 --> 24:37.947
Old Neil.

24:38.227 --> 24:39.427
Of course!

24:40.107 --> 24:42.907
This is divine providence!

24:43.587 --> 24:44.427
"He"

24:44.707 --> 24:47.387
kept whispering into my ear,

24:48.427 --> 24:49.427
telling me

24:49.907 --> 24:50.747
that "He" is...

24:51.427 --> 24:52.267
"He" is...

24:53.187 --> 24:56.787
the Hidden Sage!

24:59.747 --> 25:00.707
Nightmare.

25:20.227 --> 25:22.667
Trying to drag me into a dream?

25:23.907 --> 25:25.227
Dunn,

25:25.907 --> 25:27.347
it's useless.

25:27.907 --> 25:31.667
My eyes can see through your tricks.

25:52.107 --> 25:54.187
Let me go.

25:54.827 --> 25:57.507
I'll harm no one.

25:58.147 --> 25:58.987
I mean it.

25:59.187 --> 26:00.747
Let me go.

26:01.267 --> 26:02.467
I beg you.

26:02.987 --> 26:04.387
Please!

26:04.387 --> 26:05.267
Mr. Neil.

26:26.427 --> 26:27.267
What's this?

26:29.627 --> 26:30.987
(Peaceful Hair Strands)
Peaceful Hair Strands.

26:31.427 --> 26:33.467
(Any living creature that came into contact with it)
Silver enshrouds perpetual night,

26:33.707 --> 26:34.907
(would turn peaceful and lose all motivation.)
caressing nightmares,

26:35.347 --> 26:36.387
swaying,

26:36.987 --> 26:37.947
and sighing,

26:39.627 --> 26:41.387
until peace descends.

27:01.147 --> 27:01.987
So

27:02.987 --> 27:03.827
I've already

27:04.787 --> 27:06.467
become a monster.

27:08.387 --> 27:09.227
Let me...

27:09.467 --> 27:11.067
Let me go.

27:11.747 --> 27:13.987
I won't harm anyone.

27:14.227 --> 27:15.067
I mean it.

27:18.347 --> 27:21.787
I just want
to attempt my ritual undisturbed.

27:23.627 --> 27:24.467
Dunn,

27:24.587 --> 27:26.867
do you remember the time I saved you?

27:27.787 --> 27:28.627
Royale,

27:28.627 --> 27:32.227
do you remember when I helped you
redeem your family's lives?

27:34.387 --> 27:35.227
Klein,

27:36.147 --> 27:36.987
do you remember

27:37.587 --> 27:39.427
how I taught you every day?

27:41.187 --> 27:42.787
I'll vanish into remote mountains.

27:43.427 --> 27:44.267
I'll...

27:44.947 --> 27:46.907
I'll never show up again.

27:47.427 --> 27:48.827
I beg you.

27:52.387 --> 27:53.227
Dunn,

27:53.827 --> 27:55.427
trust me.

27:56.587 --> 27:58.107
I'll leave tonight.

27:58.547 --> 28:00.347
There'll be no complications.

28:00.827 --> 28:02.827
Spare me.

28:03.187 --> 28:04.227
I beg you.

29:08.987 --> 29:09.827
Why...

29:10.627 --> 29:12.227
Why did this happen?

29:29.627 --> 29:31.947
(Alchemical Life ingredients.)

29:32.707 --> 29:35.707
(100 ml of Spring of Elves,)

29:36.587 --> 29:38.627
(50 grams of Star Crystal,)

29:39.107 --> 29:40.547
(half a pound of pure gold,)

29:41.307 --> 29:43.227
(5 grams of phlogiston,)

29:43.907 --> 29:46.027
(5 grams of red iron,)

29:46.347 --> 29:47.427
(and)

29:47.651 --> 29:49.787
(a large quantity of fresh blood
from living people.)

29:52.227 --> 29:54.267
(I can consider drawing my own blood.)

29:56.587 --> 29:57.907
(Do as you wish,)

29:58.547 --> 29:59.747
(but do not harm.)

30:52.502 --> 30:54.307
(Raphael Cemetery)

30:54.307 --> 30:56.227
(The crimson full moon rises,)

30:57.027 --> 30:58.307
(reflecting the earth.)

31:00.427 --> 31:01.587
(Weary spirits)

31:02.307 --> 31:03.387
(halt their wandering)

31:04.587 --> 31:06.187
(and rest in the goddess's realm.)

31:07.547 --> 31:08.987
(The earth claims the flesh,)

31:09.547 --> 31:10.427
(while souls)

31:11.027 --> 31:13.187
(have long transformed into stars
within eternity.)

31:14.587 --> 31:17.027
(May the goddess pluck you
amidst angelic hymns)

31:18.107 --> 31:21.027
(along with sweet silence.)

31:22.147 --> 31:23.067
(Neil)
(Our dear friend)

31:23.707 --> 31:25.227
(and comrade-in-arms.)

31:26.387 --> 31:28.147
(May the night stars forever shine.)

31:29.387 --> 31:30.387
(May you return)

31:31.267 --> 31:32.387
(to the primordial purity.)

31:34.227 --> 31:35.587
- (The sole destination)
- (The sole destination)

31:36.107 --> 31:37.587
- (is peace.)
- (is peace.)

32:00.027 --> 32:01.947
(We are the guardians)

32:03.027 --> 32:04.267
(and also a pathetic group)

32:04.667 --> 32:07.747
(constantly fighting)

32:08.067 --> 32:09.347
(danger and madness.)

32:09.347 --> 32:11.519
(If I cannot save her,)

32:11.519 --> 32:13.699
(then I shall accompany her.)

32:57.558 --> 33:02.739
♪Burn my broken shell to new sight♪

33:03.532 --> 33:11.298
♪To be free in mist
to hold a cup of light♪

33:11.577 --> 33:14.946
♪Where are the flames
that come in fury?♪

33:15.160 --> 33:18.370
♪Where are the keys
that carve truth from me?♪

33:18.584 --> 33:24.162
♪Into the dark
to dream and scream my name♪

33:24.162 --> 33:27.362
♪Wonder or dismay♪

33:27.362 --> 33:30.988
♪Madness or decay♪

33:31.512 --> 33:33.568
♪With fragile light♪

33:33.568 --> 33:37.634
♪I vow to guard a world I stay♪

33:37.634 --> 33:41.297
♪Stirring or delay♪

33:41.297 --> 33:44.610
♪Rebirth or be same♪

33:45.177 --> 33:50.444
♪With whispers in gray
guide my shadow way♪

33:50.713 --> 33:54.274
♪Fade away♪
